     * One can peek at the data on any given GstAggregatorPad with the
       GstBase.AggregatorPad.peek_buffer() method, and remove it from the pad
       with the GstBase.AggregatorPad.pop_buffer() method. When a buffer
       has been taken with pop_buffer (), a new buffer can be queued
